<title>CROATIA: Croatian July trade deficit widens to $318 mln.</title>
<headline>Croatian July trade deficit widens to $318 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE   JULY	  JUNE	 JULY'95</p>
<p> Balance (million USD)	 -318	  -294	  -435</p>
<p> Exports			    414	   294	   352</p>
<p> Imports			    732	   588	   787</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
